      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut Brie cheese wheel in half lengthwise, creating 2 thinner wheels. Spread garlic on cut-side bottom wheel; top with 1 1/2 teaspoons red pepper jelly. Place top Brie cheese wheel on top, cut-side down. Spread remaining 1 tablespoon red pepper jelly on top Brie cheese; place in a round casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
